  {
    "uuid": "15bdcce0-ab71-5534-b9b5-feb3524f9546",
    "entry": "洋癖",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "ようへき",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "addiction to Western things",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼は重度の洋癖で、自宅の家具から普段の食事まで全てを西洋流に通さないと気が済まない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "幕末から明治にかけて、急速な文明開化の波に乗って極端な洋癖に染まる若者が続出した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女の洋癖は母親譲りで、リビングにはパリの骨董市で買い付けてきたアンティークが並んでいる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "帰朝の後は打って変りたる洋癖家となり。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "藪の鶯",
                "author": "三宅花圃",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "親父が例の洋癖家だろう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "藪の鶯",
                "author": "三宅花圃",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
